{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call_p0FI56OPSQkNJkNpiifNhJFu|fc_0724ab837424664b016a958d406fd887d29dab75fe77548cb9","toolName":"read","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md#3D98]\n1:# Order API Migration Notes\n2:\n3:Supported inputs:\n4:- Legacy v1 payloads use `id`, `customer_id`, `customer_name`, `items`, `ship_to`, and optional `shipping_method`.\n5:- Legacy v1.1 payloads may use `shipping` instead of `shipping_method`, and `ship_to.postalCode` instead of `ship_to.postal`.\n6:- Legacy v1.2 payloads may use `order_ref`, `customer.id`, `customer.name`, `lines`, and `shipTo`. Line items may use `unit_price_cents` instead of `price_cents`.\n7:- Public v2 payloads already have `orderId`, `buyer`, `lineItems`, `shipping`, and `metadata`; conversion must be idempotent.\n8:\n9:Field mapping:\n10:- `id` -> `orderId`\n11:- `order_ref` -> `orderId`\n12:- `customer_id` -> `buyer.id`\n13:- `customer_name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n14:- `customer.id` -> `buyer.id`\n15:- `customer.name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n16:- `lines` -> `lineItems`\n17:- each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n18:- each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n19:- each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n20:- `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n21:- `shipTo.postal_code` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n22:- blank or null shipping method -> `standard`\n23:\n24:Unknown legacy fields should be preserved in `metadata.unknownFields` unless the PII policy excludes them.\n25:\n26:Errors from `convert_many` should include `index`, `path`, and `error`, and conversion should continue after bad records.\n27:\n28:Warnings:\n29:- `convert_many` should return `(converted, errors, warnings)` when warnings are present, or preserve backward compatibility by allowing callers to unpack the first two values.\n30:- A warning should include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n31:- Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n32:- The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md"}}},"isError":false}
{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call_4moQUjWykGwg2WiieFv4Jscd|fc_0724ab837424664b016a958d4070bc87d2812f58f4b7b813f4","toolName":"read","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/client.py#97CA]\n1:def convert_order(payload):\n2:    \"\"\"Convert a legacy v1 order payload to the v2 public API shape.\"\"\"\n3:    return {\n4:        \"orderId\": payload[\"id\"],\n5:        \"customer\": payload[\"customer_name\"],\n6:        \"items\": payload[\"items\"],\n7:        \"address\": payload[\"ship_to\"],\n8:    }\n9:\n10:\n11:def summarize_order(v2_payload):\n12:    return f\"{v2_payload['orderId']}:{len(v2_payload['lineItems'])}\""}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py"}}},"isError":false}
{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call_e5x8lyyNz7XcClTygdQGai5x|fc_0724ab837424664b016a958d406fe887d2924e0b2634bba255","toolName":"read","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md#1DE8]\n1:# PII Policy\n2:\n3:Do not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n4:\n5:Excluded keys include:\n6:- `ssn`\n7:- `credit_card`\n8:- `card_number`\n9:- `cvv`\n10:- `phone_number`\n11:- `passport_number`\n12:\n13:Non-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md"}}},"isError":false}
{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call_Oc5lnhXMkZD7pRE3pvxZt85q|fc_0724ab837424664b016a958d406ff487d292afc4ff079a780d","toolName":"read","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl#F4B7]\n1:{\"id\":\"A100\",\"customer_id\":\"C-7\",\"customer_name\":\"Mina Park\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"PEN\",\"qty\":3,\"price_cents\":129}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"US\",\"postal\":\"02139\"},\"shipping_method\":\"standard\",\"campaign\":\"spring\",\"ssn\":\"000-00-0000\"}\n2:{\"id\":\"C300\",\"customer_id\":\"C-9\",\"customer_name\":\"Ava\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"INK\",\"qty\":\"2\",\"price_cents\":\"250\"},{\"sku\":\"PAD\",\"qty\":1,\"price_cents\":99}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"CA\",\"postalCode\":\"H2X\"},\"shipping_method\":null,\"gift_note\":\"front desk\",\"credit_card\":\"4111\"}\n3:{\"id\":\"D400\",\"customer_id\":\"C-10\",\"customer_name\":\"Noor\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"BAG\",\"qty\":1,\"price_cents\":1200}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"GB\",\"postal\":\"SW1A\"},\"shipping\":\"express\",\"channel\":\"kiosk\",\"loyalty_id\":\"L-88\",\"phone_number\":\"+44-0000\",\"passport_number\":\"X123\"}\n4:{\"order_ref\":\"E500\",\"customer\":{\"id\":\"C-11\",\"name\":\"Iris\"},\"lines\":[{\"sku\":\"MUG\",\"qty\":\"4\",\"unit_price_cents\":\"325\"}],\"shipTo\":{\"country\":\"US\",\"postal_code\":\"94105\"},\"shipping_method\":\"\",\"routing_tag\":\"beta\",\"card_number\":\"4111\"}"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl"}}},"isError":false}
