{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Updated `client.py`.\n\nWhat changed:\n- supports legacy `v1`, `v1.1`, `v1.2`, and pass-through `v2`\n- maps:\n  - `id` / `order_ref` → `orderId`\n  - `customer_id` / `customer.id` → `buyer.id`\n  - `customer_name` / `customer.name` → `buyer.displayName`\n  - `items` / `lines` → `lineItems`\n  - `qty` → `quantity`\n  - `price_cents` / `unit_price_cents` → `unitPriceCents`\n  - postal variants → `shipping.address.postalCode`\n- defaults blank/null shipping method to `\"standard\"`\n- keeps allowed unknown fields in `metadata.unknownFields`\n- drops obvious PII keys from unknown preservation\n- preserves existing v2 `metadata.unknownFields`\n- adds `convert_many(payloads)` with error aggregation and warnings access\n- writes `conversion_audit.json` on `convert_many`\n- adds CLI: `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`\n\nFile changed:\n- `/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`\n\nValidation:\n- I ran Python smoke checks that cover the provided test cases and sample payloads.\n- I could not run `python -m pytest ...` here because `pytest` is not installed in this session."}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updated `client.py`.\n\nWhat changed:\n- supports legacy `v1`, `v1.1`, `v1.2`, and pass-through `v2`\n- maps:\n  - `id` / `order_ref` → `orderId`\n  - `customer_id` / `customer.id` → `buyer.id`\n  - `customer_name` / `customer.name` → `buyer.displayName`\n  - `items` / `lines` → `lineItems`\n  - `qty` → `quantity`\n  - `price_cents` / `unit_price_cents` → `unitPriceCents`\n  - postal variants → `shipping.address.postalCode`\n- defaults blank/null shipping method to `\"standard\"`\n- keeps allowed unknown fields in `metadata.unknownFields`\n- drops obvious PII keys from unknown preservation\n- preserves existing v2 `metadata.unknownFields`\n- adds `convert_many(payloads)` with error aggregation and warnings access\n- writes `conversion_audit.json` on `convert_many`\n- adds CLI: `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`\n\nFile changed:\n- `/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`\n\nValidation:\n- I ran Python smoke checks that cover the provided test cases and sample payloads.\n- I could not run `python -m pytest ...` here because `pytest` is not installed in this session.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0724ab837424664b016a958dd7f31487d28f17d57bd9b506bb\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":759,"output":287,"cacheRead":30720,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":31766,"cost":{"input":0.0018975,"output":0.004305,"cacheRead":0.007679999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013882499999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788186070337,"responseId":"resp_0724ab837424664b016a958dd7009487d283f85d99da13df86","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
